WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.294
Hi! Today you'll learn: how do you greet people in German?
How do you say your name? Let's go!

2
00:00:13.867 --> 00:00:14.646
Good morning!

3
00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:18.792
Good day!

4
00:00:22.067 --> 00:00:23.008
Good evening!

5
00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:27.417
Good night!

6
00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:30.815
Bye!

7
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:31.990
Goodbye!

8
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.035
See you later!

9
00:00:35.433 --> 00:00:43.861
Watch the endings: ich heiße, du heißt, Sie heißen. Ich
komme, du kommst, Sie kommen. And sein is special: ich bin,
du bist, Sie sind.

10
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.935
Hi! I'm Lena. What's your name?

11
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.437
My name is Mateo.

12
00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:52.239
Where are you from?

13
00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:53.888
I'm from Colombia.

14
00:00:56.933 --> 00:01:01.197
You say du to friends and family. To adult strangers you say
Sie.

15
00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:06.401
Now it's your turn. Listen and repeat.

16
00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:26.360
Listen carefully and point to the right picture!

17
00:01:31.233 --> 00:01:32.118
der Morgen

18
00:01:37.933 --> 00:01:39.056
der Sprachkurs

19
00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:44.325
What's correct? Think for a moment!

20
00:01:49.033 --> 00:01:50.835
In the morning you say “Guten Morgen”.

21
00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:55.991
What's correct? Think for a moment!

22
00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.194
Sie takes kommen. “Sie” is capitalised.

23
00:02:06.733 --> 00:02:10.250
Great! Now you can introduce yourself in German. See you
later!
